{"id":"df2dfa78e9bb8cbb","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-Higgs-bundle.md","title":"Relative Higgs-Bundle Presentation","display":"df-Higgs-bundle — Relative Higgs-Bundle Presentation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-Higgs-bundle","aliases":["58-df-Higgs-bundle"],"display":"df-Higgs-bundle — Relative Higgs-Bundle Presentation","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-Higgs-bundle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-Higgs-bundle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-Higgs-bundle — Relative Higgs-Bundle Presentation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97bfaddac2f220a7\" href=\"?note=97bfaddac2f220a7\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md\">../batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,E,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega\\in V\">\\(p,E,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> is an explicit coefficient presentation\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,n,r,\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2,\\wedge,0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,n,r,\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2,\\wedge,0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\rangle\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H^1\">\\(\\mathcal H^1\\)</span> is the supplied carrier of holomorphic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{End}(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{End}(E)\\)</span>-valued one-forms, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H^2\">\\(\\mathcal H^2\\)</span> is the supplied carrier of their wedge squares.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Higgs\\text{-}bundle}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n,\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2,\\wedge,0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nn,r\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\Omega=\n\\langle p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,n,r,\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2,\\wedge,0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S(E,p,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\wedge,\\mathcal H^1\\times\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\theta\\in\\mathcal H^1\n\\land0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\in\\mathcal H^2\n\\land\\wedge(\\langle\\theta,\\theta\\rangle)=0_{\\mathcal H^2}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Higgs\\text{-}bundle}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n,\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2,\\wedge,0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nn,r\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\Omega=\n\\langle p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,n,r,\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2,\\wedge,0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S(E,p,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\wedge,\\mathcal H^1\\times\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\theta\\in\\mathcal H^1\n\\land0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\in\\mathcal H^2\n\\land\\wedge(\\langle\\theta,\\theta\\rangle)=0_{\\mathcal H^2}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom is explicitly relative to supplied coefficient carriers. It does not manufacture <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{hol}}(X,\\operatorname{End}(E)\\otimes\\Omega_X^i)\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{hol}}(X,\\operatorname{End}(E)\\otimes\\Omega_X^i)\\)</span> from undefined section, endomorphism-bundle, tensor, or cotangent constructors.</li>\n<li>Once an upstream construction certifies those carriers, the final wedge-zero clause is precisely the Higgs integrability condition.</li>\n<li>The eight-place public predicate is retained, so existing direct uses remain arity-compatible.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"97bfaddac2f220a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,E,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,n,r,\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2,\\wedge,0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{End}(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Higgs\\text{-}bundle}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists n,\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2,\\wedge,0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nn,r\\in\\omega\\\\\n&{}\\land\\Omega=\n\\langle p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,n,r,\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2,\\wedge,0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\rangle\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicVectorBundle}_S(E,p,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\wedge,\\mathcal H^1\\times\\mathcal H^1,\\mathcal H^2)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\theta\\in\\mathcal H^1\n\\land0_{\\mathcal H^2}\\in\\mathcal H^2\n\\land\\wedge(\\langle\\theta,\\theta\\rangle)=0_{\\mathcal H^2}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{hol}}(X,\\operatorname{End}(E)\\otimes\\Omega_X^i)","display":false}],"bytes":2003,"backlinks":[{"id":"6470837a8cdd9550","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-620","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-Higgs-bundle.md|58-df-Higgs-bundle]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["97bfaddac2f220a7","36d7463d215be751"]}